   DOI: 10.1109/TMI.2013.2265612. PMID: 26913262.
   Institution: University of Pennsylvania, Philadelphia, PA, USA.
   Abstract: B-spline FFD with anatomical landmark constraints achieves
   sub-voxel accuracy (< 1.5 mm TRE) even with post-surgical changes.

3. Balakrishnan G, Zhao A, Black MJ, Guttag J, Dalca AV. VoxelMorph: a learning
